| `Catalog` | P1 tariff identity and version, P2 validity versions, P3 `db_ref`, P4 signed package check, P5 package import, P6 sharing client, P7 exchange with the server (re-cut 2026-10-29, T4/T4b) | business-model concept 2026-10-28 (replaces section 9.2) |
