The mapping to the development document's step names: T1 = `0.1.a`, T2 = `0.1.b`, T3 = `0.1.c`, T4/T4b = `0.1.d`.

## 5. Commit and chat syntax

Format: `<scope>: <version> <phase/step> <description>`:

```text
engine: 0.1.a P1 rule matcher with months, weekdays and wrap-around windows
engine: 0.1.a P1 holidays via the holidays package, region required
editor: 0.1.c P1 form model and preview data
catalog: 0.1.d P1 contribution payload preview
```

Commit messages are English. Mention a roadmap step freely; that does not imply a version bump.
